# OmniFlow frontend environment configuration template.
# Copy to .env.local (or .env.production for a build) and adjust as needed.
# Never commit real production URLs alongside secrets; this value is not
# secret, but keeping it out of source keeps builds environment-agnostic.

# Base URL of the OmniFlow FastAPI backend. Leave UNSET for local
# development -- requests go to same-origin "/api/*", which vite.config.ts
# proxies to the local backend (default http://127.0.0.1:8000). Set this
# only when building for an environment where the frontend and backend are
# not served from a proxied same origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-host.example.com
